<section id="faq" class="sec wrap">
  <div class="shead"><span class="eyebrow">FAQ</span><h2 data-alt="Pertanyaan yang sering muncul.">Frequently asked questions.</h2></div>
  <div class="faq">
    <details class="q" open><summary><span data-alt="esprompt itu apa?">What is esprompt?</span><span class="plus">+</span></summary><p data-alt="Katalog prompt untuk membuat UI. Pilih prompt hero/section/landing page, copy, tempel ke AI tool, hasilnya langsung jadi. Yang dijual adalah prompt-nya. Kamu yang generate.">A catalog of prompts for building UI. Pick a hero, section, or full landing page prompt, copy it, paste into an AI tool, and the result appears. We sell the prompts. You generate.</p></details>
    <details class="q"><summary><span data-alt="Perlu pengalaman coding?">Do I need coding experience?</span><span class="plus">+</span></summary><p data-alt="Nggak. Kalau bisa copy-paste, kamu bisa pakai esprompt. Nggak perlu paham React, HTML, atau istilah teknis lainnya.">No. If you can copy-paste, you can use esprompt. No need to understand React, HTML, or any technical jargon.</p></details>
    <details class="q"><summary><span data-alt="Tool apa saja yang didukung?">Which AI tools does it work with?</span><span class="plus">+</span></summary><p data-alt="Semua AI coding tool populer: Cursor, v0, Lovable, Claude, Bolt, Windsurf, dan lainnya. Prompt-nya universal, nggak terikat satu tool.">All popular AI coding tools: Cursor, v0, Lovable, Claude, Bolt, Windsurf, and more. The prompts are tool-agnostic.</p></details>
    <details class="q"><summary><span data-alt="Apa bedanya Hero, Section, dan Full Landing Page?">What's the difference between Hero, Section, and Full Landing Page?</span><span class="plus">+</span></summary><p data-alt="Hero: satu section pembuka lengkap dengan aset image &amp; video. Section: satu bagian spesifik (pricing, testimonial, dll). Full Landing Page: prompt utuh untuk seluruh halaman sekaligus.">Hero: a single opening section, bundled with image &amp; video assets. Section: one specific block (pricing, testimonials, etc). Full Landing Page: one prompt that builds the entire page at once.</p></details>
    <details class="q"><summary><span data-alt="Aset image &amp; video-nya gimana?">Do Hero prompts include images and videos?</span><span class="plus">+</span></summary><p data-alt="Ya. Khusus item Hero, tersedia aset image &amp; video siap download, plus prompt aset-nya bila kamu ingin generate versi sendiri.">Yes. Hero items ship with downloadable image &amp; video assets, plus their asset prompts if you'd rather generate your own version.</p></details>
    <details class="q"><summary><span data-alt="Bagaimana skema harganya?">How does pricing work?</span><span class="plus">+</span></summary><p data-alt="Kamu bisa mulai gratis buat coba-coba katalognya. Detail tier berbayar lagi difinalisasi dan akan diumumkan sebelum peluncuran.">You can start for free to try the catalog. Paid tier details are still being finalized and will be announced before launch.</p></details>
  </div>
</section>

